+        "Traits": "Primal Bond lets the ranger add their proficiency bonus to the beast’s ability checks and saving throws. Charge adds 1d6 slashing damage if the beast moves at least 20 ft. straight toward a target and hits it with Maul that turn. A creature hit this way makes a Strength save against the ranger’s spell save DC or falls prone.",
